Next time, on Yakitate!! Japan,

00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:17.060
The sibling showdown!!

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:18.830
The first-class man chosen by Dad!

00:24:18.830 --> 00:24:19.890
Be sure to watch.

